    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>266784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>武器屋　ビショップ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Weapon Shop - Bishop</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ようこそ？
武器屋「ビショップ」へ
ごゆっくりご覧ください？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome to the
weapon shop, "Bishop"?
Take a look around?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゆっくりご覧に
なれましたか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did you have
a nice look?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>召喚術を研究してる
変人がこの村に
いるんだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have a lover in town
who's studying the
summoning artes, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>召喚術って「精霊」だろ？
そんなもんいんのかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The summoning artes involve "the
spirits," right? Do those really exist?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>召喚術を研究して、
今後の世界を支える
技術にするらしい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're studying the summoning
artes, hoping to create techniques
that will support our world in the future.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、そんな危ういもの
信用できるのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But can we really put our faith
in something that dangerous?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>東にアルヴァニスタ、
北東にミッドガルズ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alvanista to the east,
Midgard to the northeast.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>２つの大国の間が
今あまりよろしくないらしいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It doesn't seem like those two great
countries are getting along too well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>２つの国が争ってるのは
とある技術を巡ってなんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've heard the two are arguing about
a certain kind of technology.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでもいいけど
また戦争はイヤだな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't really care, but I don't
wanna deal with any more wars...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;博士が
魔科学の禁止を
唱えてるんだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Prof. Lester is advocating
for the prohibition of
all magitech, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ミッドガルズは
魔科学が便利なので
手放せないらしいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It doesn't seem like Midgard
will let go of the technology.
It's just too useful.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;博士の
魔科学禁止を後押ししてるのは
アルヴァニスタなんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alvanista are also backing
Prof. Lester's Magitech Prohibition.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのせいで
二つの国の関係が
悪化してるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Because of that, the
relationship between the
two countries is worsening.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ようこそようこそ
「ビショップ」へ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome, welcome
to "Bishop"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いい品が揃ってますよ～？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We have a lot of good stock~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>またようこそ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome anytime!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
